              ":question/problem": "Which of the following augmented matrices are in row echelon form?\n\n$$\n\\left[\n\t\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\n\t\\right]\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left[\n\t\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 7\\end{array}\n\t\\right]\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left[\n\t\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\n\t\\right]\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left[\n\t\\begin{array}{ccc|c}0 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\n\t\\right].\n$$\n\n",
